# The N.I.N.A. plugin's release tooling lives in a folder that is also called build/
# (Plugin.targets, Build-Release.ps1, Package-Plugin.ps1, and the vendored manifest
# schema and CreateManifest.ps1). The rule above is web build output, and it silently
# ignored all of it - a fresh clone could not build, deploy or package the plugin.
!nina-plugin/UnphasedNina/build/
!nina-plugin/UnphasedNina/build/**

web/app/_edgedump/
